        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 059fedbc-b098-4580-9066-10ec5ae7ea6d).Image",
        "Description": "56, I&apos;ve managed to track more signals to the Isle of Sgail, which is currently home to the Ark Society. It appears that the Kamera has two operatives working from within the Ark Control Room, setting some form of relay for the Kamera&apos;s plans. I have a theory that this will lead to a devastating cyber attack if we do not eliminate Johnson and Wilkins. Wilkins and Johnson are two of the most intelligent and ambitious Kamera technicians, having formulated their own digital language. Be careful.\r-V",
